					"content": "這也太彎彎繞繞了…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710440631
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 710440621,
					"content": "所以他想說的是什麼？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710440622
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 710440611,
					"content": "我是說…對評書不感興趣，抱歉。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710440612
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 710440612,
					"content": "唔…妳說這些我們也不懂呀。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710440613
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
