			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 710441601,
					"content": "唔，雖然我也不是很懂「磐鍵」的原理…或許可以從那邊的籠狀岩元素聚合物下手試試看？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710441602
					],
					"speakerTitle": "志瓊"
				},
				{
					"id": 710441602,
					"content": "那是什麼東西？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710441603
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 710441603,
					"content": "這些奇怪的聚合物近來一直在困擾著總務司…它們是近兩年從層岩巨淵的基岩中蔓生出來的，性質上與下面的「東西」很相近。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710441604
					],
					"speakerTitle": "志瓊"
				},
				{
					"id": 710441604,
					"content": "之所以這樣說，是因為它們能夠受到異變的影響，發生某種形式的崩解。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710441605
					],
					"speakerTitle": "志瓊"
				},
				{
					"id": 710441605,
					"content": "後來，輝山廳的調查員發現，它們一直在吸收周圍的岩元素能量，慢慢地削弱著「磐鍵」的結構…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710441606
					],
					"speakerTitle": "志瓊"
				},
				{
					"id": 710441606,
					"content": "很是邪門，就像在有意識地破壞封印陣法一樣。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710441607
					],
					"speakerTitle": "志瓊"
				},
				{
					"id": 710441607,
					"content": "我們每隔半個月就會清理一次…但這些怪東西很快又會再度蔓生出來，而且近來愈發頻繁了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710441608
					],
					"speakerTitle": "志瓊"
				},
				{
					"id": 710441608,
					"content": "或許下面的那「東西」開始變得不安分了吧…這也是七星之所以派我們下去調查的原因。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "志瓊"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 7104417,
			"completionStepIds": [],
			"beginWay": "TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL",
			"beginConditions": {
				"logic": "LOGIC_NONE",
				"conditions": [
					{
						"type": "QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL",
						"rawParams": [
							"7104413",
							"2"
						],
						"stepId": 7104413,
						"stateName": "QUEST_STATE_UNFINISHED"
					}
				]
			},
			"mark": "TALK_MARK_NONE",
			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [
					"志瓊"
				],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 710441701,
					"content": "請暫時不要和我說話，不然我又會受處分的…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710441702
					],
					"speakerTitle": "志瓊"
				},
				{
					"id": 710441702,
					"content": "「又」…？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710441703
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 710441703,
					"content": "不要在意那種小事啦…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "志瓊"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 7104418,
			"completionStepIds": [
				7104426
			],
			"beginWay": "TALK_BEGIN_AUTO",
			"beginConditions": {
				"logic": "LOGIC_NONE",
				"conditions": [
					{
						"type": "QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL",
						"rawParams": [
							"7104426",
							"2"
						],
						"stepId": 7104426,
						"stateName": "QUEST_STATE_UNFINISHED"
					}
				]
			},
			"mark": "TALK_MARK_NONE",
			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [
					"志瓊"
				],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 710441801,
					"content": "好厲害…不愧是前輩！這應該就是最後一座了，封鎖層岩巨淵的陣法應該已經失效了。我們隨時可以下去探索啦。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710441802
					],
					"speakerTitle": "志瓊"
				},
				{
					"id": 710441802,
					"content": "唔…不過在那之前，還是要先跟沐寧打聲招呼才行…哼，那傢伙又要擺臭臉教訓我們囉。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "志瓊"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 7104419,
			"completionStepIds": [
				7104429
			],
			"beginWay": "TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL",
			"beginConditions": {
				"logic": "LOGIC_NONE",
				"conditions": [
					{
						"type": "QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL",
						"rawParams": [
							"7104429",
							"2"
						],
						"stepId": 7104429,
						"stateName": "QUEST_STATE_UNFINISHED"
					}
				]
			},
			"mark": "TALK_MARK_NONE",
			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [
					"沐寧",
					"志瓊"
				],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 710441901,
					"content": "瞧我是怎麼說的！妳果然沒有老老實實看守倉庫！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710441902
					],
					"speakerTitle": "沐寧"
				},
				{
					"id": 710441902,
					"content": "這下事情鬧大了，妳想怎麼收場呀，志瓊？妳能負得了擅自解除陣法的責任嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710441903
					],
					"speakerTitle": "沐寧"
				},
				{
					"id": 710441903,
					"content": "#啊，{F#妳}{M#你}來了。唉…擅自破壞「磐鍵」的事情，{F#妳}{M#你}怎麼解釋？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710441904,
						710441905
					],
					"speakerTitle": "沐寧"
				},
				{
					"id": 710441904,
					"content": "美觀起見，這裡拆掉柱子順眼多了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710441906
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 710441906,
					"content": "#{F#妳}{M#你}…！哼，先說好責任由{F#妳}{M#你}自負，剩下的等七星怪罪下來再說吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710441907
					],
					"speakerTitle": "沐寧"
				},
				{
					"id": 710441907,
					"content": "嘿嘿，沒關係的。沐寧這人就是這樣，只會對那些不管事的人發脾氣…別看他性子急，人還是不壞的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710441908
					],
					"speakerTitle": "志瓊"
				},
				{
					"id": 710441908,
					"content": "#不用管他的臭脾氣。等{F#妳}{M#你}準備好，我就叫上大家一同隨{F#妳}{M#你}下礦。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710441918
					],
					"speakerTitle": "志瓊"
				},
				{
					"id": 710441918,
					"content": "我們這次的目的，是進入層岩巨淵的最深層，測繪地圖，以及…嗯，調查層岩巨淵異變的源頭。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710441909
					],
					"speakerTitle": "志瓊"
				},
				{
					"id": 710441909,
					"content": "啊！抱歉，差點忘了…歡迎加入層岩巨淵勘探隊！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710441910
					],
					"speakerTitle": "志瓊"
				},
				{
					"id": 710441910,
					"content": "請容我浪費一點時間，介紹一下勘探隊的成員吧：",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710441911
					],
					"speakerTitle": "志瓊"
				},
				{
					"id": 710441911,
					"content": "首先是海迪夫，從須彌來的特約學者。主要研究方向是礦產和生物學。他是勘探隊的主要負責人…嗯，我是說科學和財政方面。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710441912
					],
					"speakerTitle": "志瓊"
				},
				{
					"id": 710441912,
					"content": "然後，是瑾武姐，她是我們的安全技術員。負責設備修理和維護，我們的安全由她來保障。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710441913
					],
					"speakerTitle": "志瓊"
				},
				{
					"id": 710441913,
					"content": "還有…呃，塔列辛。是蒙德來的吟遊詩人…不知為什麼堅持要和我們一同下礦。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710441914
					],
					"speakerTitle": "志瓊"
				},
				{
					"id": 710441914,
					"content": "或許在下礦以後，我們還會遇見意料之外的新夥伴吧？哈哈，誰知道呢！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710441915
					],
					"speakerTitle": "志瓊"
				},
				{
					"id": 710441915,
					"content": "最後，我呢，是親力親為的勘查員！負責為大家探路以及繪製地圖！和前輩共勉！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710441916
					],
					"speakerTitle": "志瓊"
				},
				{
					"id": 710441916,
					"content": "等前輩準備好了，就去礦坑邊的起重機那裡吧…以前是運貨用的，不過吊幾個人上下礦也完全不是問題。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710441917
					],
					"speakerTitle": "志瓊"
				},
				{
					"id": 710441917,
					"content": "唔，對喔…既然前輩有「風之翼」，即使不用起重機也可以很方便地下去吧？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "志瓊"
				},
				{
					"id": 710441905,
					"content": "如果你真想阻止我，早就趕我走了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710441918
					]
				}
			]
		},
		{
